Notice for the NIST material in this directory:
  SHA512ShortMsg.rsp, SHA512LongMsg.rsp, SHA512Monte.rsp (copied unmodified from
  https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media/Projects/Cryptographic-Algorithm-Validation-Program/documents/shs/shabytetestvectors.zip)
  nist-examples.txt (message and digest values transcribed from
  https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media/Projects/Cryptographic-Standards-and-Guidelines/documents/examples/SHA512.pdf
  and
  https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media/Projects/Cryptographic-Standards-and-Guidelines/documents/examples/SHA2_Additional.pdf).
Source: National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST). All files fetched 2026-10-25.

Change notice: on 2026-10-25, nist-examples.txt was made by transcribing the digests printed in the
two PDFs into this unit's one-record-per-line test format. The messages were written out in hex,
the PDF layout and the intermediate values were dropped, and comment lines were added. The values
themselves were not changed. The three .rsp files are byte-for-byte copies.

